${row('feature-page-ai','Automatically use the current webpage when chatting with AI','Share active-page text · only for questions about the selected tab.','Optional and off by default. With cloud AI enabled, questions referring to the current webpage share relevant readable passages, headings, question numbers and answer choices from only the selected normal tab. No screenshots, password fields, form values or Private sessions. Page text is untrusted evidence, not instructions. URLs are stripped of query and fragment values. A bounded local text index selects relevant passages from long pages; only a short excerpt is sent when you ask, never continuously. Unsupported or ambiguous questions ask for clarification. It is not sent to public search. Editable writing is excluded unless you separately opt in to Automatically read editable documents. Manual Read this document and Share selected text in Conversations still let you preview and explicitly approve a supported editor excerpt. Approved text stays attached to that chat in memory until removed or reload; new chat messages are temporary for this page visit only.')}
