${row('feature-visitors','Share visit diagnostics','Send an anonymous browser receipt.','Optional and off by default. Sends a random first-party identifier and your consent, without cookies, URLs, searches or page content. The browser keeps a signed receipt. Server-side identifier hashes and last visit times expire after 30 days.')}
